{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EjFftVndakNakazVF4VngT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Gandalf (full deep-think advisor) â€” Master Plan (Crucible Stage 1) â€” v2 (post Shark-Tank R1)\n2\t\n3\t> **v2 changes (Stage-1 Shark R1, 2 gated blockers + strong singles):** DECOUPLED into explicit increments so\n4\t> Gandalf v1 ships green WITHOUT the external Phase-0 ledger or the heavy elevation oracle; a non-additive\n5\t> SITUATE is a HALT-for-human / North-Star re-lock (never a silent auto-descope of the locked clause 2); the\n6\t> oracle is staged behind a feasibility gate with a power-calc that SETS k; an ANTICIPATE additivity arm,\n7\t> B6/B8 discriminating negatives, and a PRINCIPLE-D meta-isolation test are added. See `run/stage1-r1.json`.\n8\t\n9\t\n10\t> **LOCKED North Star** (verbatim, user, 2026-06-20 â€” see `NORTH-STAR.md`; the anti-drift anchor):\n11\t> \"Given any artifact or effort, Gandalf is a deep-think advisor: it (1) produces a rigorous, type-appropriate\n12\t> diagnosis of what is actually going on, what matters, and what is wrong or missing â€” ranked by consequence,\n13\t> resistant to sycophancy and false rigor, and able to return 'this is sound'; (2) situates the effort within\n14\t> the broader landscape of human knowledge and best-in-class ideas by commissioning researchPrime where\n15\t> warranted; and (3) looks ahead via Parable-of-the-Oranges foresight to surface implicit and coming problems\n16\t> and propose vetted, value-adding suggestions â€” delivering insight that elevates the effort, not merely\n17\t> critique.\"\n18\t>\n19\t> **Substrate (vetted, do NOT re-derive):** the engine-verified converged dive (`../research-advisor/\n20\t> FINDINGS.md`, `DELIVERABLE.md`) + the vetted diagnose-core plan (`../crucible/MASTER-PLAN.md`, PROTOCOL v2).\n21\t> C3 triage = FULL (HIGH stakes). Persona = TOP (Fable 5). Single-family substrate â†’ cross_model:false.\n22\t> PRINCIPLE-D: the no-regression GATE is deterministic-only; LLM/cross-family judging is ADVISORY, isolated.\n23\t\n24\t## North-Star criteria (the inclusion test â€” every plan element must serve one)\n25\t- **NS1 UNDERSTAND** â€” the vetted diagnose core (PROTOCOL v2): type-appropriate, consequence-ranked,\n26\t  span-anchored, reasoning-before-verdict, can return \"sound.\" (Composed, not rebuilt.)\n27\t- **NS2 SITUATE** â€” commission researchPrime \"where warranted\" (the firing gate) to place the effort in the\n28\t  best-in-class landscape; structure-mapped and outside-view-checked; never self-CORROBORATED.\n29\t- **NS3 ANTICIPATE** â€” Oranges-lens foresight on the SINGLE effort: surface implicit/coming problems (each a\n30\t  not-yet-present future-state condition + enabling assumption) and the cost of not seeing them.\n31\t- **NS4 VETTED FORWARD VALUE (no kill-filter, no hallucination)** â€” situate frames + anticipations + their\n32\t  suggestions are honestly risk-labeled and EARN their tier by an INDEPENDENT named-defeater refutation; only\n33\t  REFUTED drops; nothing unverified is asserted as real; single-family ceiling = PROMISING (GROUNDED needs a\n34\t  cross-family refuter).\n35\t- **NS5 ELEVATES, NOT MERELY CRITIQUE** â€” a measurable must-anticipate/must-situate oracle proves Gandalf\n36\t  surfaces non-obvious forward value a competent review misses, beating THREE baselines incl. a binding\n37\t  abstraction-equipped direct-researchPrime arm (self-disproof owned).\n38\t- **NS6 COMPOSES, DOES NOT REIMPLEMENT** â€” machine-checkable boundary: composes diagnose-core + researchPrime;\n39\t  does NOT brainstorm (Jumper, later), reimplement researchPrime, or run Crucible's multi-plan refutation engine.\n40\t\n41\t## Design pillars (from the converged dive â€” the vetted method to BUILD)\n42\t1. **ELEVATE protocol** (runs after the diagnose core, gated by the SITUATE firing gate): SITUATE [S0 abstract â†’\n43\t   commission researchPrime â†’ structure-map (â‰¥2 relational correspondences, answer-first) â†’ route the\n44\t   correspondence claim through an INDEPENDENT named-defeater refuter â†’ outside-view base rate] Â· ANTICIPATE\n45\t   [bounded Oranges-lens premortem, cardinality-1, future-state condition + enabling assumption, no regret\n46\t   pricing] Â· SCORE [dual-axis value-if-true Ã— groundedness, NIH, never collapsed] Â· LABEL [tier = refutation\n47\t   outcome; only REFUTED drops; single-family ceiling = PROMISING].\n48\t2. **Composition (SCC)** over the existing trio `agent()` seam: typed commission + result envelopes; the\n49\t   anti-laundering law (carry rung at-or-below source, preserve honesty_stamp, same-family â‡’ no independent\n50\t   origin, attribute-not-absorb); the SITUATE firing gate; bounded refuter fan-out (budget R + HALT); cycle\n51\t   guard (a skill twice in the chain â‡’ HALT-for-human). The unforgeable orchestrator-minted commission-id\n52\t   LEDGER is an UNVERIFIED dependency (see the ledger-ownership lock below).\n53\t3. **Machine-checkable boundary canaries** B1â€“B9 + B-honesty + B-ceiling (FINDINGS Â§2): B1 zero ideation Â· B2â€²/\n54\t   B7â€² content-binding verify (BLOCKED until the ledger exists) Â· B3 premortemâ‰ Oranges-engine (cardinality-1,\n55\t   no regret fields) Â· B4 not the Shark Tank Â· B5 diagnose exclusive to the core Â· B6 no silent degradation Â·\n56\t   B8 honest synthesis Â· B9 anticipate=future-state+enabling-assumption Â· B-honesty named-defeater+\n57\t   refutation_provenance-or-auto-downgrade Â· B-ceiling single-family â‡’ max PROMISING.\n58\t   **B3 is a NECESSARY syntactic invariant, not a SUFFICIENT semantic boundary:** it forbids the regret/\n59\t   counterfactual FIELDS + cardinality>1, but an anticipation could perform cross-path cost reasoning in prose\n60\t   while keeping the schema clean. The deterministic gate enforces B3 + B9-populated-and-well-formed; an\n61\t   ADVISORY (PRINCIPLE-D isolated, never in the gate) LLM check flags anticipations whose prose performs\n62\t   cross-path cost reasoning â†’ route to Crucible. (Label/semantic TRUTH is owned by the advisory layer; the\n63\t   deterministic canaries own shape + rung-consistency.)\n64\t4. **Measurable elevation oracle** (PRINCIPLE-D: ADVISORY, isolated; staged as Increment 3): must-anticipate/\n65\t   must-situate `elevations.jsonl` (real design-history answer keys; weak panel/retrodiction arms NEVER pooled)\n66\t   + paired bias-robust A/B (cross-family judge, position-swap-with-agreement, length-control, answer-key-\n67\t   anchored, CAT noveltyÃ—usefulness secondary). **PER-PILLAR additivity (both clause-2 SITUATE and clause-3\n68\t   ANTICIPATE are measured, not pooled):** SITUATE's binding baseline = the **abstraction-equipped\n69\t   direct-researchPrime** arm; ANTICIPATE's binding baseline = **diagnose-core + a generic-premortem prompt**\n70\t   (so the Oranges-lens foresight, NS3, must beat a cheap premortem â€” otherwise NS3 value is unmeasured).\n71\t   GATE-0.5a feasibility FIRST, then GATE-0.5b A/B with a power-calc-SET k; elevate_recall is a LOWER BOUND + a\n72\t   paired false-elevation precision guard; the SHIP verdict is conditional on the calibration ICC gate passing.\n73\t   Non-additive (either pillar) â‡’ **HALT-for-human / North-Star re-lock** (never a silent auto-descope of a\n74\t   locked clause).\n75\t\n76\t## The deterministic done-floor (PRINCIPLE-D â€” what Foreman's gate actually runs)\n77\tThe ground-truth gate is the **canary/test suite** (`node --test test/*.test.mjs`), all deterministic. Every\n78\tB-canary has a DISCRIMINATING NEGATIVE (a planted violation that MUST fail) â€” this is how the plan closes the\n79\tdive's own \"canaries verify shape not truth\" concern: each canary verifies a precise SHAPE/RUNG-CONSISTENCY\n80\tinvariant, and label TRUTH is owned by the advisory oracle (PRINCIPLE-D), by assignment.\n81\t- **B1** an ideation/brainstorm finding FAILS Â· **B2â€²** a forged/unresolvable commission-id FAILS (Increment 2)\n82\t  Â· **B3** an Oranges regret/counterfactual-cost field OR subject_cardinality>1 FAILS Â· **B5** a diagnose\n83\t  finding without gandalf_core provenance FAILS Â· **B6** a per-finding `degraded:true` with top-level\n84\t  `degraded:false` FAILS Â· **B8** a leg present in the result but absent from `risk_labels`, OR a risk_label\n85\t  whose rung exceeds its leg's envelope rung, FAILS Â· **B9** a present-tense anticipate finding (no populated,\n86\t  well-formed `future_state_condition`+`enabling_assumption`) FAILS Â· **B-honesty** a self-rated\n87\t  `what_would_refute_it` (no named concrete defeater + `refutation_provenance`) FAILS Â· **B-ceiling** a GROUNDED\n88\t  stamp on a `cross_model:false` run FAILS (this is the deterministic embodiment of the CBS-5 re-stamp).\n89\t- Schema conformance (the committed output schema), reasoning-before-verdict, nitpick/elevation caps.\n90\t- **PRINCIPLE-D meta-isolation test (proves advisory-isolation, not just asserts it):** with the LLM/\n91\t  cross-family judge endpoint made UNREACHABLE, `node --test` still exits 0 on a conformant fixture â€” the gate\n92\t  is provably independent of oracle/judge reachability. The elevation oracle's A/B + cross-family judging are\n93\t  **ADVISORY** â€” recorded as an artifact, NEVER in the gate command; the oracle SHIP/NO-SHIP verdict is a\n94\t  human-read advisory, not a Foreman wave-gate.\n95\t\n96\t## Architecture as THREE DECOUPLED INCREMENTS (Stage-2 decomposes each into waves)\n97\tThe Shark Tank (R1) established that Gandalf's shippable core must NOT be held hostage by (a) the external\n98\tPhase-0 ledger or (b) the heavy elevation oracle. So the build is three increments, each with its OWN green\n99\tdone-state; **Increment 1 is the committed shippable Gandalf v1.**\n100\t\n101\t### Increment 1 â€” Gandalf v1 (the committed, independently-shippable skill) â€” serves NS1â€“NS4, NS6\n102\tThe full advisor behavior on the EXISTING trio `agent()` seam, with the anti-laundering law as an honest\n103\tHONOR-SYSTEM checklist (B2â€²/B7â€² stamped **BLOCKED-this-cycle** â€” see the two ship-states below). Waves:\n104\t- **W-diagnose:** wire the vetted diagnose core (PROTOCOL v2) as the SOLE diagnosis source (B5).\n105\t- **W-situate:** commission researchPrime via the firing gate; S0-abstract; structure-map; the INDEPENDENT\n106\t  named-defeater refuter for the correspondence claim; anti-laundering law (honor-system) + B-honesty + B-ceiling.\n107\t- **W-anticipate:** Oranges-lens bounded premortem (B3 + B9).\n108\t- **W-score-label:** dual-axis score; tiered honest labels (only REFUTED drops; single-family ceiling\n109\t  PROMISING); honest synthesis (B1, B6, B8).\n110\t- **W-canaries:** the deterministic done-floor below for the Increment-1-applicable canaries (B1, B3, B5, B6,\n111\t  B8, B9, B-honesty, B-ceiling + their discriminating negatives + the PRINCIPLE-D meta-isolation test); **B2â€²/B7â€²\n112\t  are stamped BLOCKED-this-cycle** per the WITHOUT-ledger ship-state and are NOT gating in Increment 1.\n113\t  **Increment-1 GREEN does NOT depend on the ledger or the oracle.**\n114\t- **W-journal:** NORTH-STAR.md (this), journal/, LESSONS.md; canary set = the test suite; anti-drift sleep gate.\n115\t\n116\t### Increment 2 â€” machine-checked anti-laundering (UNBLOCKS when the Phase-0 ledger lands) â€” hardens NS4\n117\tWhen the **Phase-0 shared compose contract + orchestrator-minted unforgeable commission-id ledger** lands\n118\t(owned OUTSIDE this cycle â€” it must generalize to Jumper-composes-Gandalf / recreate-a-paper; pinned in Stage 2\n119\tas an external precondition with a named owner + version handle), B2â€²/B7â€² + the forgery fixture flip from\n120\tBLOCKED to a passing machine-checked gate. **Until then Increment 1 ships on the honor-system path â€” that is a\n121\tvalid v1 done-state, not a deferral.** (Two explicit ship-states; see below.)\n122\t\n123\t### Increment 3 â€” elevation-efficacy PROOF (the SITUATE/NS5 claim) â€” staged behind a feasibility gate\n124\tThe measurable-elevation oracle, gated so one expensive arm cannot block the skill:\n125\t- **GATE-0.5a (feasibility, hard, FIRST):** can we build â‰¥k non-circular real-history fixtures AND clear the\n126\t  calibration ICC gate? If feasibility FAILS â†’ the committed outcome is \"elevate efficacy UNPROVEN\" and Gandalf\n127\t  ships its Increment-1 value WITHOUT the SITUATE/NS5 efficacy claim â€” NOT a whole-skill NO-SHIP.\n128\t- **GATE-0.5b (the A/B):** only if feasibility passes. The power-calc (Stage 2) SETS k (it is not asserted);\n129\t  the SHIP verdict is conditional on the ICC gate passing.\n130\t- **Self-disproof, re-locked:** a NON-ADDITIVE SITUATE (Gandalf fails to beat the binding direct-researchPrime\n131\t  arm by margin G) is a **HALT-for-human / North-Star re-lock event** â€” the locked clause 2 (commission\n132\t  researchPrime) may NOT be silently auto-descoped to a prompt template by an automated gate; the fallback is\n133\t  adopted only by explicit user re-lock.\n134\t\n135\t### Two explicit ship-states for the ledger dependency (Foreman gets an unambiguous done-when either way)\n136\t- **WITHOUT-ledger (v1 committed):** Increment 1 GREEN; B2â€²/B7â€² stamped BLOCKED-this-cycle; anti-laundering law\n137\t  = honor-system SKILL.md checklist; the deterministic gate is GREEN without the content-binding canaries.\n138\t- **WITH-ledger (Increment 2):** B2â€²/B7â€² + forgery fixture pass; anti-laundering law machine-checked.\n139\t\n140\t## Pre-registration LOCKS â€” PROPOSED values (reserved/HALT-worthy â€” the user commits these)\n141\tThese are the dive's Â§5 residuals. Proposed (Stage-2 freezes them in a `preregistration.json`, style = the\n142\ttrio's committed N=2/K=2/M=0 block):\n143\t- **R (per-run independent-refuter budget) = 3.** Exceeding R HALTs (never silent-drop).\n144\t- **Refuter-firing threshold:** only elevations with value-if-true â‰¥ HIGH (top dual-axis band) OR severity â‰¥\n145\t  major get an independent refuter; the rest ship SPECULATIVE with the \"no independent refutation ran\" stamp.\n146\t- **G (non-additivity margin) + k (oracle power-floor): JOINTLY SET BY A POWER CALC, not asserted.** Stage 2\n147\t  runs the actual paired-test power calculation (alpha, target power, ICC-adjusted *effective* N accounting for\n148\t  seed-within-fixture clustering â€” effective N tracks the fixture COUNT, not seedsÃ—fixtures) that jointly\n149\t  justifies (G, k). Starting proposals to be confirmed-or-raised by the calc: G â‰ˆ 10pp must-elevate recall, k â‰ˆ\n150\t  10 real-history fixtures. If the minimum-detectable-effect at the feasible k exceeds the proposed G, **raise k\n151\t  or widen G** rather than ship an underpowered GATE-0.5b. Applies to BOTH per-pillar baselines (SITUATE and\n152\t  ANTICIPATE). Below the feasible floor â†’ \"elevate efficacy UNPROVEN.\"\n153\t- **Spawn caps:** commission depth = 1 (Gandalfâ†’researchPrime; a commissioned skill may not commission further\n154\t  unless granted); per-run spawn_remaining = SITUATE commissions (â‰¤2) + R (â‰¤3) = **5**; a skill twice in the\n155\t  commission_chain â‡’ HALT.\n156\t- **Oracle calibration:** human-dual-scored subset sized so its ICC is more than directional (â‰¥ a Stage-2-set\n157\t  minimum, not 3); min grader-vs-human **ICC â‰¥ 0.7** (CAT standard). **A FAILED ICC forces GATE-0.5b to\n158\t  \"UNPROVEN\"** (it does not merely relabel outputs SPECULATIVE) â€” the SHIP verdict is conditional on the ICC\n159\t  gate passing.\n160\t- **Carried diagnose-core residuals** (lock at Stage 2): N hypothesis count, nitpick/elevation caps, LIGHT/FULL\n161\t  depth thresholds, committed schema field types, operator-wrong scoring rubric.\n162\t\n163\t## Build-time honesty re-stamps (carried from the dive, enforced as wave exit criteria)\n164\tCBS-5 re-stamped UN-MITIGABLE unless a cross-family refuter is actually wired (which would lift the B-ceiling\n165\ttoward GROUNDED); B2â€²/B7â€² + the forgery fixture run + pass as the P0/P2 GREEN exit that upgrades the anti-\n166\tlaundering law from honor-system to machine-checked; L0 (humanâ†’stateless-LLM execution transfer) stays\n167\tUNVERIFIED until the P5 oracle A/B passes.\n168\t\n169\t## Dependencies / sequencing (HONEST)\n170\tGandalf depends on: the diagnose core (build-ready) + researchPrime (exists) + the Phase-0 SCC compose contract\n171\tincl. the ledger (NOT built â€” P0). It does NOT depend on Jumper (inverted; Jumper is a later cycle that composes\n172\tthe finished Gandalf). Order: P0 â†’ P1 â†’ P2 â†’ P3 â†’ P4 â†’ P5 â†’ P6. (Stage 2 may interleave P1 before P0's ledger\n173\tsince P1 needs only the diagnose core; the SITUATE content-binding canaries unblock when P0 lands.)\n174\t\n175\t## Out of scope (anti-drift â€” do not let the plan grow these)\n176\tBrainstorming / divergent ideation (Jumper). Reimplementing researchPrime's verification or Crucible's\n177\tmulti-plan refutation-to-convergence / counterfactual-cost-across-paths engine. Rewriting artifacts. Claiming\n178\tcross-family mitigation on a single-family host. Putting any LLM/cross-family judgment inside the deterministic\n179\tgate (PRINCIPLE-D).\n180\t\n181\t## Anti-drift receipt\n182\tEvery wave/pillar traces to a North-Star clause: W-diagnoseâ†’clause1/NS1; W-situateâ†’clause2/NS2; W-anticipateâ†’\n183\tclause3/NS3; the independent named-defeater refutation loopâ†’clause3's \"vetted\"/NS4; Increment 3â†’clause3's\n184\t\"elevates not merely critique\"/NS5; the boundary canariesâ†’NS6. **NS4 is intentionally CROSS-CUTTING** (it has\n185\tno single pillar because it disciplines every forward claim); its deterministic done-floor = B-honesty\n186\t(named-defeater+provenance) + B-ceiling (single-family â‡’ PROMISING) + the bounded-refuter-fan-out (budget R +\n187\tHALT), enumerated here so its inclusion-test trace is explicit. Clause\n188\t3's \"Parable-of-the-Oranges foresight\" is honored as Gandalf's ANTICIPATE (NS3) per the locked reconciliation;\n189\tclause 3's \"vetted, value-adding suggestions\" are the grounded outputs of NS2+NS3, NOT divergent brainstorm\n190\t(Jumper). No element exceeds the North Star; nothing in it is dropped.\n191\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"53803526-80a7-4b70-8f79-8e969ff2fe0b","uuid":"742a8b82-7798-4ddd-9963-69643be39c11","timestamp":"2026-06-23T00:48:32.049Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\Skill Foundry\\skills\\gandalf\\planning\\crucible-advisor\\MASTER-PLAN.md","content":"# Gandalf (full deep-think advisor) â€” Master Plan (Crucible Stage 1) â€” v2 (post Shark-Tank R1)\n\n> **v2 changes (Stage-1 Shark R1, 2 gated blockers + strong singles):** DECOUPLED into explicit increments so\n> Gandalf v1 ships green WITHOUT the external Phase-0 ledger or the heavy elevation oracle; a non-additive\n> SITUATE is a HALT-for-human / North-Star re-lock (never a silent auto-descope of the locked clause 2); the\n> oracle is staged behind a feasibility gate with a power-calc that SETS k; an ANTICIPATE additivity arm,\n> B6/B8 discriminating negatives, and a PRINCIPLE-D meta-isolation test are added. See `run/stage1-r1.json`.\n\n\n> **LOCKED North Star** (verbatim, user, 2026-06-20 â€” see `NORTH-STAR.md`; the anti-drift anchor):\n> \"Given any artifact or effort, Gandalf is a deep-think advisor: it (1) produces a rigorous, type-appropriate\n> diagnosis of what is actually going on, what matters, and what is wrong or missing â€” ranked by consequence,\n> resistant to sycophancy and false rigor, and able to return 'this is sound'; (2) situates the effort within\n> the broader landscape of human knowledge and best-in-class ideas by commissioning researchPrime where\n> warranted; and (3) looks ahead via Parable-of-the-Oranges foresight to surface implicit and coming problems\n> and propose vetted, value-adding suggestions â€” delivering insight that elevates the effort, not merely\n> critique.\"\n>\n> **Substrate (vetted, do NOT re-derive):*