 dive â€” the vetted method to BUILD)\n1. **ELEVATE protocol** (runs after the diagnose core, gated by the SITUATE firing gate): SITUATE [S0 abstract â†’\n   commission researchPrime â†’ structure-map (â‰¥2 relational correspondences, answer-first) â†’ route the\n   correspondence claim through an INDEPENDENT named-defeater refuter â†’ outside-view base rate] Â· ANTICIPATE\n   [bounded Oranges-lens premortem, cardinality-1, future-state condition + enabling assumption, no regret\n   pricing] Â· SCORE [dual-axis value-if-true Ã— groundedness, NIH, never collapsed] Â· LABEL [tier = refutation\n   outcome; only REFUTED drops; single-family ceiling = PROMISING].\n2. **Composition (SCC)** over the existing trio `agent()` seam: typed commission + result envelopes; the\n   anti-laundering law (carry rung at-or-below source, preserve honesty_stamp, same-family â‡’ no independent\n   origin, attribute-not-absorb); the SITUATE firing gate; bounded refuter fan-out (budget R + HALT); cycle\n   guard (a skill twice in the chain â‡’ HALT-for-human). The unforgeable orchestrator-minted commission-id\n   LEDGER is an UNVERIFIED dependency (see the ledger-ownership lock below).\n3. **Machine-checkable boundary canaries** B1â€“B9 + B-honesty + B-ceiling (FINDINGS Â§2): B1 zero ideation Â· B2â€²/\n   B7â€² content-binding verify (BLOCKED until the ledger exists) Â· B3 premortemâ‰ Oranges-engine (cardinality-1,\n   no regret fields) Â· B4 not the Shark Tank Â· B5 diagnose exclusive to the core Â· B6 no silent degradation Â·\n   B8 honest synthesis Â· B9 anticipate=future-state+enabling-assumption Â· B-honesty named-defeater+\n   refutation_provenance-or-auto-downgrade Â· B-ceiling single-family â‡’ max PROMISING.\n   **B3 is a NECESSARY syntactic invariant, not a SUFFICIENT semantic boundary:** it forbids the regret/\n   counterfactual FIELDS + cardinality>1, but an anticipation could perform cross-path cost reasoning in prose\n   while keeping the schema clean. The deterministic gate enforces B3 + B9-populated-and-well-formed; an\n   ADVISORY (PRINCIPLE-D isolated, never in the gate) LLM check flags anticipations whose prose performs\n   cross-path cost reasoning â†’ route to Crucible. (Label/semantic TRUTH is owned by the advisory layer; the\n   deterministic canaries own shape + rung-consistency.)\n4. **Measurable elevation oracle** (PRINCIPLE-D: ADVISORY, isolated; staged as Increment 3): must-anticipate/\n   must-situate `elevations.jsonl` (real design-history answer keys; weak panel/retrodiction arms NEVER pooled)\n   + paired bias-robust A/B (cross-family judge, position-swap-with-agreement, length-control, answer-key-\n   anchored, CAT noveltyÃ—usefulness secondary). **PER-PILLAR additivity (both clause-2 SITUATE and clause-3\n   ANTICIPATE are measured, not pooled):** SITUATE's binding baseline = the **abstraction-equipped\n   direct-researchPrime** arm; ANTICIPATE's binding baseline = **diagnose-core + a generic-premortem prompt**\n   (so the Oranges-lens foresight, NS3, must beat a cheap premortem â€” otherwise NS3 value is unmeasured).\n   GATE-0.5a feasibility FIRST, then GATE-0.5b A/B with a power-calc-SET k; elevate_recall is a LOWER BOUND + a\n   paired false-elevation precision guard; the SHIP verdict is conditional on the calibration ICC gate passing.\n   Non-additive (either pillar) â‡’ **HALT-for-human / North-Star re-lock** (never a silent auto-descope of a\n   locked clause).\n\n## The deterministic done-floor (PRINCIPLE-D â€” what Foreman's gate actually runs)\nThe ground-truth gate is the **canary/test suite** (`node --test test/*.test.mjs`), all deterministic. Every\nB-canary has a DISCRIMINATING NEGATIVE (a planted violation that MUST fail) â€” this is how the plan closes the\ndive's own \"canaries verify shape not truth\" concern: each canary verifies a precise SHAPE/RUNG-CONSISTENCY\ninvariant, and label TRUTH is owned by the advisory oracle (PRINCIPLE-D), by assignment.\n- **B1** an ideation/brainstorm finding FAILS Â· **B2â€²** a forged/unresolvable commission-id FAILS (Increment 2)\n  Â· **B3** an Oranges regret/counterfactual-cost field OR subject_cardinality>1 FAILS Â· **B5** a diagnose\n  finding without gandalf_core provenance FAILS Â· **B6** a per-finding `degraded:true` with top-level\n  `degraded:false` FAILS Â· **B8** a leg present in the result but absent from `risk_labels`, OR a risk_label\n  whose rung exceeds its leg's envelope rung, FAILS Â· **B9** a present-tense anticipate finding (no populated,\n  well-formed `future_state_condition`+`enabling_assumption`) FAILS Â· **B-honesty** a self-rated\n  `what_would_refute_it` (no named concrete defeater + `refutation_provenance`) FAILS Â· **B-ceiling** a GROUNDED\n  stamp on a `cross_model:false` run FAILS (this is the deterministic embodiment of the CBS-5 re-stamp).\n- Schema conformance (the committed output schema), reasoning-before-verdict, nitpick/elevation caps.\n- **PRINCIPLE-D meta-isolation test (proves advisory-isolation, not just asserts it):** with the LLM/\n  cross-family judge endpoint made UNREACHABLE, `node --test` still exits 0 on a conformant fixture â€” the gate\n  is provably independent of oracle/judge reachability. The elevation oracle's A/B + cross-family judging are\n  **ADVISORY** â€” recorded as an artifact, NEVER in the gate command; the oracle SHIP/NO-SHIP verdict is a\n  human-read advisory, not a Foreman wave-gate.\n\n## Architecture as THREE DECOUPLED INCREMENTS (Stage-2 decomposes each into waves)\nThe Shark Tank (R1) established that Gandalf's shippable core must NOT be held hostage by (a) the external\nPhase-0 ledger or (b) the heavy elevation oracle. So the build is three increments, each with its OWN green\ndone-state; **Increment 1 is the committed shippable Gandalf v1.**\n\n### Increment 1 â€” Gandalf v1 (the committed, independently-shippable skill) â€” serves NS1â€“NS4, NS6\nThe full advisor behavior on the EXISTING trio `agent()` seam, with the anti-laundering law as an honest\nHONOR-SYSTEM checklist (B2â€²/B7â€² stamped **BLOCKED-this-cycle** â€” see the two ship-states below). Waves:\n- **W-diagnose:** wire the vetted diagnose core (PROTOCOL v2) as the SOLE diagnosis source (B5).\n- **W-situate:** commission researchPrime via the firing gate; S0-abstract; structure-map; the INDEPENDENT\n  named-defeater refuter for the correspondence claim; anti-laundering law (honor-system) + B-honesty + B-ceiling.\n- **W-anticipate:** Oranges-lens bounded premortem (B3 + B9).\n- **W-score-label:** dual-axis score; tiered honest labels (only REFUTED drops; single-family ceiling\n  PROMISING); honest synthesis (B1, B6, B8).\n- **W-canaries:** the deterministic done-floor below for the Increment-1-applicable canaries (B1, B3, B5, B6,\n  B8, B9, B-honesty, B-ceiling + their discriminating negatives + the PRINCIPLE-D meta-isolation test); **B2â€²/B7â€²\n  are stamped BLOCKED-this-cycle** per the WITHOUT-ledger ship-state and are NOT gating in Increment 1.\n  **Increment-1 GREEN does NOT depend on the ledger or the oracle.**\n- **W-journal:** NORTH-STAR.md (this), journal/, LESSONS.md; canary set = the test suite; anti-drift sleep gate.\n\n### Increment 2 â€” machine-checked anti-laundering (UNBLOCKS when the Phase-0 ledger lands) â€” hardens NS4\nWhen the **Phase-0 shared compose contract + orchestrator-minted unforgeable commission-id ledger** lands\n(owned OUTSIDE this cycle â€” it must generalize to Jumper-composes-Gandalf / recreate-a-paper; pinned in Stage 2\nas an external precondition with a named owner + version handle), B2â€²/B7â€² + the forgery fixture flip from\nBLOCKED to a passing machine-checked gate. **Until then Increment 1 ships on the honor-system path â€” that is a\nvalid v1 done-state, not a deferral.** (Two explicit ship-states; see below.)\n\n### Increment 3 â€” elevation-efficacy PROOF (the SITUATE/NS5 claim) â€” staged behind a feasibility gate\nThe measurable-elevation oracle, gated so one expensive arm cannot block the skill:\n- **GATE-0.5a (feasibility, hard, FIRST):** can we build â‰¥k non-circular real-history fixtures AND clear the\n  calibration ICC gate? If feasibility FAILS â†’ the committed outcome is \"elevate efficacy UNPROVEN\" and Gandalf\n  ships its Increment-1 value WITHOUT the SITUATE/NS5 efficacy claim â€” NOT a whole-skill NO-SHIP.\n- **GATE-0.5b (the A/B):** only if feasibility passes. The power-calc (Stage 2) SETS k (it is not asserted);\n  the SHIP verdict is conditional on the ICC gate passing.\n- **Self-disproof, re-locked:** a NON-ADDITIVE SITUATE (Gandalf fails to beat the binding direct-researchPrime\n  arm by margin G) is a **HALT-for-human / North-Star re-lock event** â€” the locked clause 2 (commission\n  researchPrime) may NOT be silently auto-descoped to a prompt template by an automated gate; the fallback is\n  adopted only by explicit user re-lock.\n\n### Two explicit ship-states for the ledger dependency (Foreman gets an unambiguous done-when either way)\n- **WITHOUT-ledger (v1 committed):** Increment 1 GREEN; B2â€²/B7â€² stamped BLOCKED-this-cycle; anti-laundering law\n  = honor-system SKILL.md checklist; the deterministic gate is GREEN without the content-binding canaries.\n- **WITH-ledger (Increment 2):** B2â€²/B7â€² + forgery fixture pass; anti-laundering law machine-checked.\n\n## Pre-registration LOCKS â€” PROPOSED values (reserved/HALT-worthy â€” the user commits these)\nThese are the dive's Â§5 residuals. Proposed (Stage-2 freezes them in a `preregistration.json`, style = the\ntrio's committed N=2/K=2/M=0 block):\n- **R (per-run independent-refuter budget) = 3.** Exceeding R HALTs (never silent-drop).\n- **Refuter-firing threshold:** only elevations with value-if-true â‰¥ HIGH (top dual-axis band) OR severity â‰¥\n  major get an independent refuter; the rest ship SPECULATIVE with the \"no independent refutation ran\" stamp.\n- **G (non-additivity margin) + k (oracle power-floor): JOINTLY SET BY A POWER CALC, not asserted.** Stage 2\n  runs the actual paired-test power calculation (alpha, target power, ICC-adjusted *effective* N accounting for\n  seed-within-fixture clustering â€” effective N tracks the fixture COUNT, not seedsÃ—fixtures) that jointly\n  justifies (G, k). Starting proposals to be confirmed-or-raised by the calc: G â‰ˆ 10pp must-elevate recall, k â‰ˆ\n  10 real-history fixtures. If the minimum-detectable-effect at the feasible k exceeds the proposed G, **raise k\n  or widen G** rather than ship an underpowered GATE-0.5b. Applies to BOTH per-pillar baselines (SITUATE and\n  ANTICIPATE). Below the feasible floor â†’ \"elevate efficacy UNPROVEN.\"\n- **Spawn caps:** commission depth = 1 (Gandalfâ†’researchPrime; a commissioned skill may not commission further\n  unless granted); per-run spawn_remaining = SITUATE commissions (â‰¤2) + R (â‰¤3) = **5**; a skill twice in the\n  commission_chain â‡’ HALT.\n- **Oracle calibration:** human-dual-scored subset sized so its ICC is more than directional (â‰¥ a Stage-2-set\n  minimum, not 3); min grader-vs-human **ICC â‰¥ 0.7** (CAT standard). **A FAILED ICC forces GATE-0.5b to\n  \"UNPROVEN\"** (it does not merely relabel outputs SPECULATIVE) â€” the SHIP verdict is conditional on the ICC\n  gate passing.\n- **Carried diagnose-core residuals** (lock at Stage 2): N hypothesis count, nitpick/elevation caps, LIGHT/FULL\n  depth thresholds, committed schema field types, operator-wrong scoring rubric.\n\n## Build-time honesty re-stamps (carried from the dive, enforced as wave exit criteria)\nCBS-5 re-stamped UN-MITIGABLE unless a cross-family refuter is actually wired (which would lift the B-ceiling\ntoward GROUNDED); B2â€²/B7â€² + the forgery fixture run + pass as the P0/P2 GREEN exit that upgrades the anti-\nlaundering law from honor-system to machine-checked; L0 (humanâ†’stateless-LLM execution transfer) stays\nUNVERIFIED until the P5 oracle A/B passes.\n\n## Dependencies / sequencing (HONEST)\nGandalf depends on: the diagnose core (build-ready) + researchPrime (exists) + the Phase-0 SCC compose contract\nincl. the ledger (NOT built â€” P0). It does NOT depend on Jumper (inverted; Jumper is a later cycle that composes\nthe finished Gandalf). Order: P0 â†’ P1 â†’ P2 â†’ P3 â†’ P4 â†’ P5 â†’ P6. (Stage 2 may interleave P1 before P0's ledger\nsince P1 needs only the diagnose core; the SITUATE content-binding canaries unblock when P0 lands.)\n\n## Out of scope (anti-drift â€” do not let the plan grow these)\nBrainstorming / divergent ideation (Jumper). Reimplementing researchPrime's verification or Crucible's\nmulti-plan refutation-to-convergence / counterfactual-cost-across-paths engine. Rewriting artifacts. Claiming\ncross-family mitigation on a single-family host. Putting any LLM/cross-family judgment inside the deterministic\ngate (PRINCIPLE-D).\n\n## Anti-drift receipt\nEvery wave/pillar traces to a North-Star clause: W-diagnoseâ†’clause1/NS1; W-situateâ†’clause2/NS2; W-anticipateâ†’\nclause3/NS3; the independent named-defeater refutation loopâ†’clause3's \"vetted\"/NS4; Increment 3â†’clause3's\n\"elevates not merely critique\"/NS5; the boundary canariesâ†’NS6. **NS4 is intentionally CROSS-CUTTING** (it has\nno single pillar because it disciplines every forward claim); its deterministic done-floor = B-honesty\n(named-defeater+provenance) + B-ceiling (single-family â‡’ PROMISING) + the bounded-refuter-fan-out (budget R +\nHALT), enumerated here so its inclusion-test trace is explicit. Clause\n3's \"Parable-of-the-Oranges foresight\" is honored as Gandalf's ANTICIPATE (NS3) per the locked reconciliation;\nclause 3's \"vetted, value-adding suggestions\" are the grounded outputs of NS2+NS3, NOT divergent brainstorm\n(Jumper). No element exceeds the North Star; nothing in it is dropped.\n","numLines":191,"startLine":1,"totalLines":191}}}
